{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Three Routes: Run Walk Cycle 是一款為跑步、步行與單車愛好者而設的路線規劃及記錄工具，可從家門出發規劃三條循環路線，並以 GPS 記錄訓練。此終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $29.99，適合希望離線規劃路線及追蹤進度的人士。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-192.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線規劃三條循環路線</h2>\n<p>用戶可選擇步行、跑步或單車，設定距離或時間，取得三條由家門出發的循環或折返路線。可下載指定地區離線地圖並在 iPhone 直接規劃，也可用手指畫出路線；路線風格包括寧靜街道、公園、平坦、多坡、步道及無梯級，並顯示爬升、高度剖面、路面與沿途設施。記錄時支援 GPS、語音轉向提示及 Apple Watch。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-129-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-130-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-131-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-132-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-133-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-134-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Three Routes: Run Walk Cycle 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Three Routes: Run Walk Cycle</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id6823810305\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T16:27:30.862222+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":483,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T16:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T10:53:37.435102+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T16:20:59.654722+00:00","content_hash":"6996779e114ba7b15c2e0b8b30d50d357f456d55e685dd4ec8ca94c078a4b10a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}